Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 14:48:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 23/32] Expose server-authored principals to plugins

Carry the authenticated actor's canonical p6r PrincipalKey through HTTP and RPC plugin request contexts. Return a provider-scoped denotation handle so identity providers can project their directory subjects without duplicating key serialization or authenticating browser input. Keep anonymous contexts nullable and cover the public SDK contract plus shared wire behavior.
